      {
        "id": "NilahQ",
        "name": "Formless Blade",
        "description": "With a snap of her whip-blade, Nilah damages any enemies she hits in a straight line in her chosen direction. This action extends her attack range for a short duration.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Nilah gains (30%) Armor Penetration, and her Attacks against champions restore <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(20%) damage dealt as Health</span>. Overhealing from this is converted into a <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shield</span> for 4 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Nilah cracks her whip-blade, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(0/10/20/30/40 + (100% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. If an enemy unit or structure is hit, Nilah gains 125 Attack Range and <span>(10 ~ 60)Attack Speed</span>, and her Attacks hit in a cone for 4 seconds.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Damage is increased by her Critical Strike Chance and Critical Strike Damage at 70% effectiveness.<br />If cast during <span>Slipstream</span>, Nilah creates a wave of water striking all enemies along Nilah's path. </span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Area attacks deal 33% damage to minions and 100% damage to monsters.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This ability executes low Health minions.</span>",
